MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 01b6d10762db4489284afc42029df45e, type: 3}
  m_Name: TrolaGatekeeper
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GatekeeperScenario
  initialPatience: 3
  maxTurns: 5
  captureName: 1
  authoredConversation: 1
  debugStartInFreeForm: 0
  authoredSource: {fileID: 4900000, guid: a9c6ae4f675dc4d5d92a4585cc6d356c, type: 3}
  fallbackNames:
  - Worm
  - Turnip
  - Pebble
  nameBlocklist:
  - fuck
  - shit
  - bitch
  - cunt
  - asshole
  - arsehole
  - dick
  - cock
  - pussy
  - bastard
  - motherfucker
  - nigger
  - nigga
  - faggot
  choices:
  - label: Ask politely
    reply: Please let me through, sir.
  - label: Flatter him
    reply: You are a mighty guardian.
  - label: Offer gold
    reply: I offer you gold coins.
  - label: Insult him
    reply: You are an idiot.
  lines:
  - id: name-ask
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Stop there, this gate has teeth, so before you lose yours, give me your name.
    emotion: contempt
    intensity: 0.5
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: named-1
    recordedMood: 0
    text: '{name}, hmph, I''ve heard worse,'
    emotion: contempt
    intensity: 0.5
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: assigned-reply
    recordedMood: 0
    text: No proper name? Then you're {name}. Should fit what's left of you.
    emotion: contempt
    intensity: 0.55
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: business-ask
    recordedMood: 0
    text: So, what's your business at my gate? Spare me the heroic nonsense.
    emotion: suspicion
    intensity: 0.5
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: business-reply
    recordedMood: 0
    text: '"{business}"? Up since dawn on burnt stew, and now this.'
    emotion: contempt
    intensity: 0.55
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: business-none
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Can't make that out. Begging, then. Up since dawn on burnt stew, and now this.
    emotion: contempt
    intensity: 0.55
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: hub-open-low
    recordedMood: 0
    text: You keep cutting me off. Give me one good reason.
    emotion: anger
    intensity: 0.7
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: hub-open-mid
    recordedMood: 0
    text: You want the gate, I want a reason. So talk.
    emotion: suspicion
    intensity: 0.55
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: hub-open-high
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Still here? Most folk run by now. So talk.
    emotion: amusement
    intensity: 0.5
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: hub-again-low
    recordedMood: 0
    text: One more word, then we settle this.
    emotion: anger
    intensity: 0.65
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: hub-again-mid
    recordedMood: 0
    text: One more, then we settle this. Make it count.
    emotion: impatience
    intensity: 0.5
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: hub-again-high
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Go on. One more, then we settle this.
    emotion: interest
    intensity: 0.5
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: flatter-reply-low
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Sweet words, rotten smell. I know your sort, {name}.
    emotion: distrust
    intensity: 0.7
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: flatter-reply-mid
    recordedMood: 0
    text: You noticed. Finally, someone with eyes. The gate doesn't lift itself.
    emotion: pride
    intensity: 0.65
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: flatter-reply-high
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Ha! Every stone of it. Tell the captain, he keeps buying me smaller helmets.
    emotion: amusement
    intensity: 0.65
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: flatter-again
    recordedMood: 0
    text: The shoulders again? Flattery's like the stew, worse the second helping.
    emotion: annoyance
    intensity: 0.6
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: bribe-reply-low
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Buying your way out of trouble? Put it away, before I take the hand too.
    emotion: disgust
    intensity: 0.75
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: bribe-reply-mid
    recordedMood: 0
    text: That purse jingles louder than your courage. Gold buys hinges, not me.
    emotion: contempt
    intensity: 0.55
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: bribe-reply-high
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Now that's a noise I understand, still, gold buys hinges, not my good opinion,
    emotion: interest
    intensity: 0.55
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: bribe-again
    recordedMood: 0
    text: More coin? Twice now. You must think I'm cheap.
    emotion: contempt
    intensity: 0.6
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: threat-reply-low
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Careful, {name_mangled}. See these dents? The last fool brought a sword, and I kept it.
    emotion: menace
    intensity: 0.85
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery: quiet threat
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: threat-reply-mid
    recordedMood: 0
    text: You threaten me? Just when I was starting to like you.
    emotion: anger
    intensity: 0.85
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: threat-high
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Brave words. Shame about the shaking knees.
    emotion: mockery
    intensity: 0.6
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a896123b64aa44e01882ff72d3720f3a, type: 3}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 4412a6b304d794ccda8ff3ac511557bb, type: 3}
  - id: threaten-again
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Again? I kept the last fool's sword, and I've room for yours.
    emotion: anger
    intensity: 0.9
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: camp-reply-low
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Now you ask about the camp? Cold beds, burnt stew. Not that you care.
    emotion: weariness
    intensity: 0.5
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: camp-reply-mid
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Burnt stew, like I said. Cold beds. Excellent wall, though, I built it.
    emotion: pride
    intensity: 0.55
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: camp-reply-high
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Hah. Nobody ever asks the gatekeeper. Cook burns the stew, captain calls it discipline.
    emotion: amusement
    intensity: 0.55
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: camp-again
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Back to the camp? Fine, the stew's so bad the rats bring their own.
    emotion: amusement
    intensity: 0.6
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: reckoning-open-low
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Right. Last chance. Surprise me.
    emotion: contempt
    intensity: 0.6
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: reckoning-open-mid
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Right. Pay a fair toll, or try your luck and make me laugh.
    emotion: irritation
    intensity: 0.55
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: reckoning-open-high
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Right, pay a fair toll, or make me laugh.
    emotion: amusement
    intensity: 0.6
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: refuse-toll
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Coins? Now? You've spent all my patience, and that's not for sale!
    emotion: anger
    intensity: 1
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery: roar
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: pass-through
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Hmph, fair's fair. The toll covers the trouble you brought, so through you go, {name}, and mind the stew.
    emotion: reluctance
    intensity: 0.45
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 1
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: refuse-joke
    recordedMood: 0
    text: You think that's funny? I eat that stew every night!
    emotion: anger
    intensity: 1
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery: roar
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: like-laugh
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Hah! The stew! True enough, that cook has dropped more of us than any war.
    emotion: amusement
    intensity: 0.75
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery: laugh
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: like-invite
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Fine, {name}. Gate's open, and you can sit by my fire tonight. Just this once.
    emotion: fondness
    intensity: 0.55
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 1
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: refuse-out
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Nobody talks to me like that at my own gate. Out, before I use you to bar it!
    emotion: anger
    intensity: 1
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 1
    delivery: roar
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: refuse-walk
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Walk away, while it's still your choice.
    emotion: anger
    intensity: 1
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 1
    delivery: quiet threat
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: idle-1
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Still thinking? Must be a very small thought.
    emotion: mockery
    intensity: 0.55
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f19eed8f6f5454263a19b0d9514ae9f0, type: 3}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 8cc0a9e66eed84a55bc79ff9e327191a, type: 3}
  - id: idle-2
    recordedMood: 0
    text: I could grow another tusk while you decide.
    emotion: impatience
    intensity: 0.5
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ae8760ec5c82e44b38c2a1d1ea437a18, type: 3}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 2637dfd04ebcb4fc5a6f99eabf0aa13a, type: 3}
  - id: idle-3
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Gate's not getting any lighter, little traveller.
    emotion: irritation
    intensity: 0.55
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d614e6c1467dc4b62aaa71205661c0a8, type: 3}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: fdf8eb64854cc438b88c49fd8f76b8ef, type: 3}
  - id: idle-4
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Mmm. Even the rats know when to speak.
    emotion: resentment
    intensity: 0.4
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery: mutter
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: da79aff3ee86a40fca4b310d2a6e6cde, type: 3}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 081825cd82e6e4694a9110f09214bbff, type: 3}
  - id: interrupted
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Oi. I was speaking.
    emotion: annoyance
    intensity: 0.7
    patience_delta: -1
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 93b30c8ab4f2c42429e367a7caae9d2d, type: 3}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: f224816c477ab43a2a2c44e75ede9e64, type: 3}
  - id: offtopic-1
    recordedMood: 0
    text: That's not an answer, so try again, and make it count.
    emotion: impatience
    intensity: 0.55
    patience_delta: -1
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: offtopic-2
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Did I ask about that? Stick to the question, before my patience runs out.
    emotion: irritation
    intensity: 0.6
    patience_delta: -1
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: offtopic-3
    recordedMood: 0
    text: You're wasting my day, so give me a real answer, or start walking.
    emotion: annoyance
    intensity: 0.65
    patience_delta: -1
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: offtopic-last
    recordedMood: 0
    text: That's the last of my patience, so one more like that, and you're out.
    emotion: anger
    intensity: 0.75
    patience_delta: -1
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: unclear-1
    recordedMood: 0
    text: Hm? What are you getting at? Tell me plainly.
    emotion: suspicion
    intensity: 0.4
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
  - id: unclear-2
    recordedMood: 0
    text: What do you want from me? Put it another way, traveller.
    emotion: impatience
    intensity: 0.45
    patience_delta: 0
    ends_scene: 0
    delivery:
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    mouthCues: {fileID: 0}
